              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu babaandi babarama baambana mu liechubo ne silaamo khu Baisiraeli, basaayi, Balawi, baliindi be Lukaangu, babembi be kimienya mu Lukaangu, bakholi be mu Lukaangu, ne babaandi boosi ba baaba bari khwilaka lia Wele beyaula babeene khukhwama khu baakwa. Baba alala ne bakhasi, ne babaana babwe boosi ba baaba bakhulu lundi banyala bamanya siikholekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bano batubaana ne Baisiraeli basiaabwe ne babemeelesi babwe mu khwechuba bali, bacha khumenya khuloondekhana ne Lilaka lia Wele, nilio Wele aana khubirira khu mukholi wewe Musa. Lundi bacha khuria ne khuloonda kamalaka koosi niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wefwe akhulaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
