        },
        {
          "text": " Kaaba bali baakwa bareera biakhulia namwe sisiindu siosi siosi khukhukusia efwe mu Sabato namwe mu ndaalo yosi yosi endakatifu, se khucha khubakulakho ta. Buli mu mwiiko kwa saba se khucha khulima kimikuunda ta, lundi khucha khubeela kamakobi koosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
