            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Buli mwiiko khucha khuroosia buli mulala bitonyi biraano bie fwesa khuyeeta khulwe kimilimo kie mu Lukaangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimilimo kino kili: kumukaati kwe khubao, biakhulia bia buli lwoosi, chisabato, kimieesi kimiya naikara chicharoborwa, bibiindu bitakatifu ne biianwa bie khurusiao bumayaanu khulwa Isiraeli. Lundi biaba khulwe kimilimo kioosi kie munju eya Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi efwe, basaayi ne Balawi, khwapile chikura khureera biianwa bie chiikhu munju eya Wele khuloondekhana ne chikholo chefwe. Khukhachireere mu biise bibienyekha buli mwiiko khulwe khufuunikha khu alutare yo mwami khuloondekhana ne kakaandikwa mu lilaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
