              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 18.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khucha khuyilila basaayi munju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi bufu buroke khukhwama khu biakhulia nibio khunyoa khukesa buli mwiiko ne bitura biefwe bibiindi bie ndali, kamafura ke kimiseituni, ne bibiaamo bioosi bibiaukhaane. Khucha khuyilila Balawi, baroosia bitonyi bie likhumi mu mikuunda kie mu birekere biefwe, bitonyi bie likhumi khukhwama mu biamo bibiama mu maloba kefwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
