                  "text": "Khub. 18.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne omusaayi khukhwama munju eya Aruni, abao alala ne Balawi bitonyi bie likhumi ne biroosebwa. Ne Balawi bakhoya bareere mu Lukaangu sitonyi khu nibio barosiisie bare mwibiikhilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila Baisiraeli ne Balawi bakhoya khureera biianwa bie biakhulia, endali ne kamafura mu libiikhilo. Ao niio bibiindu bie khulilakho bie Lukaangu bibikhwa lundi niio basaayi bali khu milimo, baliindi be Lukaangu, ne babembi be kimienya kie mu Lukaangu bamenyile. Se khucha khwanjukha enju eya Wele wefwe tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.39"
            ]
          }
        }
